#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:5 1f338407d84141888955ef9266871941
msgid "Circle Mode"
msgstr "Circle 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:7 25898f494de749c3ac94d4b77f612363
msgid ""
"Circle will orbit a point located :ref:`CIRC_RADIUS<CIRC_RADIUS>` meters in "
"front of the vehicle when the mode is entered."
msgstr "进入该模式时，Circle 将围绕车辆正前方 :ref:`CIRC_RADIUS<CIRC_RADIUS>` 米处的点进行绕圈飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:10 9767df80e2d844e195dc74a8129543c4
msgid ""
"Setting the :ref:`CIRC_RADIUS<CIRC_RADIUS>` to zero will cause the rover to "
"simply stay in place."
msgstr "将 :ref:`CIRC_RADIUS<CIRC_RADIUS>` 设置为零将使 Rover 原地停止。"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:13 607db76b9cda47c79bdf24aef574eb1c
msgid ""
"The speed of the vehicle (in meters/second) is set by the "
":ref:`CIRC_SPEED<CIRC_SPEED>` parameter. And the direction is set by the "
":ref:`CIRC_DIR<CIRC_DIR>` parameter, \"0\" is CW, \"1\" CCW."
msgstr ""
"车辆速度（米/秒）由 :ref:`CIRC_SPEED<CIRC_SPEED>` 参数设置。方向由 :ref:`CIRC_DIR<CIRC_DIR>` "
"参数设置，「0」为顺时针，「1」为逆时针。"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:17 4cb0776ee8d04e309f634586e4828426
msgid "Operation Notes"
msgstr "操作说明"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:19 ca89c9a48f0d45c1ba96a642b991b5be
msgid ""
"The target point moving around the circle does not slowdown if the vehicle "
"cannot keep up. This means that a too high a :ref:`CIRC_RADIUS<CIRC_RADIUS>`"
" parameter value will lead to the vehicle driving at full throttle inside "
"the desired radius."
msgstr ""
"圆圈上的目标点不会因车辆跟不上而减速。这意味着 :ref:`CIRC_RADIUS<CIRC_RADIUS>` "
"参数值过大会导致车辆在期望半径内以满油门行驶。"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:20 fc2929c5611b41a0972ddc445d2277e8
msgid ""
"The radius, speed and direction parameters only take effect when the vehicle"
" enters circle mode (or begins a LOITER_TURNS mission command) so users "
"cannot easily change the radius or direction while in the mode. Instead they"
" must exit and re-enter the mode. In missions, the speed can be changed "
"using the DO_CHANGE_SPEED MAVlink or mission command."
msgstr ""
"半径、速度和方向参数仅在车辆进入 Circle 模式时（或开始执行 LOITER_TURNS "
"任务命令时）生效，因此用户无法在模式运行期间轻松更改半径或方向，必须退出后重新进入该模式。在任务中，可使用 DO_CHANGE_SPEED "
"MAVLink 或任务命令更改速度。"
